{"seq":1,"slug":"keeping-context-fresh","title":"保持上下文新鲜","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-native-engineering/project-context-files/maintaining-context-files/keeping-context-fresh","wordCount":2204,"readingTime":9,"html":"<h1 id=\"保持上下文新鲜\">保持上下文新鲜</h1><h2 id=\"概述\">概述</h2><p>上下文文件最危险的状态不是缺失,而是<strong>陈旧</strong>。缺失时 agent 知道自己不知道,会去查代码、读配置、试探命令;陈旧时它拿着一份&quot;看起来很权威&quot;的说明书,理直气壮地执行早已废弃的流程。更麻烦的是,今天的主流工具把这份风险结构化了:Codex 在每次会话开始时装配一次指令链,并按 <code>project_doc_max_bytes</code>(默认 32 KiB)封顶截断(<a href=\"https://learn.chatgpt.com/docs/agent-configuration/agents-md.md\">Codex 官方文档</a>);Gemini CLI 把全局、工作区、按需三层找到的 GEMINI.md 拼接后随每条 prompt 发给模型(<a href=\"https://github.com/google-gemini/gemini-cli/blob/main/docs/cli/gemini-md.md\">Gemini CLI 文档</a>);Claude Code 每个 session 都从全新的 context window 起步,靠 CLAUDE.md 与 auto memory 把知识带过去(<a href=\"https://code.claude.com/docs/en/memory\">Claude Code 文档</a>)。文件一旦过期,污染的不是某次对话,而是此后每一次会话的起点。本节讲清过期为什么比没有更糟、上下文从哪些缝隙里悄悄过期、以及用什么机制保鲜。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>保鲜建立在四个概念上：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>过期比缺失更危险</strong>：空白让 agent 去调查，过期让 agent 服从——错误指令反而获得最高执行优先级。</li>\n<li><strong>陈旧率</strong>：每类事实有各自的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>λ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lambda</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span></span></span></span></span>，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>P</mi><mtext>fresh</mtext></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>λ</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P_{\\text{fresh}}(t) = e^{-\\lambda t}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">fresh</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8491em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8491em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">λ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>λ</mi><mtext>命令</mtext></msub><mo>&gt;</mo><msub><mi>λ</mi><mtext>结构</mtext></msub><mo>&gt;</mo><msub><mi>λ</mi><mtext>约定</mtext></msub><mo>&gt;</mo><msub><mi>λ</mi><mtext>原则</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lambda_{\\text{命令}} &gt; \\lambda_{\\text{结构}} &gt; \\lambda_{\\text{约定}} &gt; \\lambda_{\\text{原则}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">命令</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">结构</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">约定</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">原则</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>。</li>\n<li><strong>保险的三层机制</strong>：变更即同步（原子性）、装载可观测（审计对真实生效内容）、结构性防腐（就近作用域 + 低衰减表达）。</li>\n<li><strong>信用余额</strong>：过期内容的终局是「失信」——即使大部分仍正确，也没有人再按它行动。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>一句话：维护新鲜度不只是减少误导，更是保住整份文件的信用。</p>\n<h2 id=\"过期比缺失更危险\">过期比缺失更危险</h2><p>空白与过期的区别是认识论层面的:面对空白,agent 的默认行为是调查——读 <code>package.json</code>、翻构建脚本、试探性地跑命令,每一步都带着怀疑;面对过期信息,它的默认行为是服从——上下文文件的全部意义就是&quot;免调查直接做对&quot;,于是错误指令反而获得了最高的执行优先级。Anthropic 在官方文档里还警告了第二层风险:两条互相矛盾的规则同时存在时,&quot;Claude 可能任意挑一条执行&quot;,因此官方建议定期复查并清理过期与冲突的指令(<a href=\"https://code.claude.com/docs/en/memory\">Claude Code 文档</a>)。也就是说,过期内容不只是&quot;没用&quot;,它会与正确内容竞争;而长上下文中的注意力分配本就不均匀——模型对位于开头与结尾的信息利用最好,对中部最差(<a href=\"https://arxiv.org/abs/2307.03172\">Lost in the Middle, arXiv:2307.03172</a>)。一条埋在中部、又恰好过期的规则,既占着 token,又在关键时刻误导。</p>\n<p>一条上下文条目从准确走向有害,通常经过这样一条退化路径:</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"stateDiagram-v2\" data-source=\"stateDiagram-v2&#10;    [*] --&gt; 准确: 初次写入&#10;    准确 --&gt; 准确: 随同 commit 同步更新&#10;    准确 --&gt; 漂移: 代码先改,文档没跟&#10;    漂移 --&gt; 准确: 新鲜度审计发现并修正&#10;    漂移 --&gt; 过期: 连续改动仍未同步&#10;    过期 --&gt; 误导: 被当作权威执行&#10;    误导 --&gt; 失信: 反复踩坑后无人再信&#10;    失信 --&gt; [*]\">stateDiagram-v2\n    [*] --&gt; 准确: 初次写入\n    准确 --&gt; 准确: 随同 commit 同步更新\n    准确 --&gt; 漂移: 代码先改,文档没跟\n    漂移 --&gt; 准确: 新鲜度审计发现并修正\n    漂移 --&gt; 过期: 连续改动仍未同步\n    过期 --&gt; 误导: 被当作权威执行\n    误导 --&gt; 失信: 反复踩坑后无人再信\n    失信 --&gt; [*]</pre><p>值得注意的是终点:&quot;失信&quot;意味着这份文件在团队认知里已经死亡——即使其中大部分内容仍然正确,也没有人会再按它行动。维护新鲜度的目标因此不只是减少误导,更是保住整份文件的信用余额;信用破产的文档,写得再好也等于不存在。</p>\n<h2 id=\"过期从哪里发生\">过期从哪里发生</h2><p>过期来源可以按事实的&quot;易变等级&quot;分类。下表把常见来源、对应的 agent 故障模式和防腐写法放在一起:</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>过期来源</th>\n<th>典型触发事件</th>\n<th>agent 会错成什么样</th>\n<th>防腐写法</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>命令变更</td>\n<td>包管理器或脚本迁移(如 npm→pnpm)</td>\n<td>反复跑失败命令,并试图修一个不存在的错</td>\n<td>写&quot;以 package.json scripts 为准&quot;+入口指针</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>结构重构</td>\n<td>模块搬迁、monorepo 化</td>\n<td>去旧路径找文件,或在已有模块旁重建一份</td>\n<td>描述职责边界,不列具体路径清单</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>约定翻转</td>\n<td>格式化工具、风格决策变更</td>\n<td>新代码沿用被否决的风格,PR 全线返工</td>\n<td>记录决定+日期+&quot;取代了什么&quot;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>坑位变化</td>\n<td>旧坑修复,或新坑出现</td>\n<td>白白绕开已修复的坑,或踩进新坑</td>\n<td>每条坑注明验证时间,定期复核</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>易变细节</td>\n<td>行号、文件数、版本号自然演化</td>\n<td>引用不存在的行号与计数,小错不断</td>\n<td>从源头就不写这类细节</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>这背后有一个可以量化的直觉(原创启发式,非经验定律):每类事实都有各自的&quot;陈旧率&quot;<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>λ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lambda</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span></span></span></span></span>,一条写入时准确的知识的存活概率随时间指数衰减:</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>P</mi><mtext>fresh</mtext></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>λ</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msup><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"/><msub><mi>λ</mi><mtext>命令</mtext></msub><mo>&gt;</mo><msub><mi>λ</mi><mtext>结构</mtext></msub><mo>&gt;</mo><msub><mi>λ</mi><mtext>约定</mtext></msub><mo>&gt;</mo><msub><mi>λ</mi><mtext>原则</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P_{\\text{fresh}}(t) = e^{-\\lambda t}, \\qquad \\lambda_{\\text{命令}} &gt; \\lambda_{\\text{结构}} &gt; \\lambda_{\\text{约定}} &gt; \\lambda_{\\text{原则}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">fresh</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0935em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8991em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">λ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:2em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">命令</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">结构</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">约定</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">原则</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>命令级事实在活跃项目里可能几周就换一版,而&quot;为什么选这个架构&quot;级别的原则往往几年不动。模型的工程含义很直接:把有限的维护注意力花在高 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>λ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lambda</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span></span></span></span></span> 条目上,或者干脆让高 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>λ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lambda</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span></span></span></span></span> 信息不进上下文文件——用指针指向真正的权威源(CI 配置、<code>package.json</code>、schema 文件),让易变的事实留在唯一会被同步更新的地方。</p>\n<h2 id=\"保鲜的三层机制\">保鲜的三层机制</h2><p><strong>第一层:变更即同步。</strong> 改动命令、约定、结构的同一个 commit 里顺手更新上下文。这不只是勤快问题,而是原子性设计:同一 PR 中评审者同时看到&quot;行为变了&quot;和&quot;说明变了&quot;,漂移窗口为零;拆到事后补,漂移窗口就是无限期。agents.md 官方 FAQ 对&quot;以后能更新吗&quot;的回答只有一句:Treat AGENTS.md as living documentation(<a href=\"https://agents.md\">agents.md</a>)。</p>\n<p><strong>第二层:让实际装载可观测。</strong> &quot;我写了&quot;和&quot;它被装载了&quot;之间隔着截断、跳过与静默忽略:Codex 在累计 32 KiB 后停止追加文件,Claude Code 的 auto memory 只装载前 200 行或 25KB(两处均见各自官方文档:<a href=\"https://learn.chatgpt.com/docs/agent-configuration/agents-md.md\">Codex</a>、<a href=\"https://code.claude.com/docs/en/memory\">Claude Code</a>)。所以新鲜度审计必须看真实生效的内容而非源文件:Gemini CLI 提供 <code>/memory show</code>(显示拼接后的完整生效内容)与 <code>/memory reload</code>(强制重扫全部文件),页脚还会显示已装载的 context 文件数量(<a href=\"https://github.com/google-gemini/gemini-cli/blob/main/docs/cli/gemini-md.md\">Gemini CLI 文档</a>);Claude Code 用 <code>/context</code> 查看 Memory files 清单。周期性的对照审计——逐条核对生效内容与现实是否一致——能揪出那些从未被触发、因而从未暴露的过期条目。</p>\n<p><strong>第三层:结构性防腐。</strong> 用作用域隔离易变内容。Codex 的解析规则是&quot;离被编辑文件最近的文件胜出&quot;,OpenAI 自己的主仓库因此在官网示例中就有 88 份嵌套 AGENTS.md(<a href=\"https://agents.md\">agents.md</a>);Claude Code 的子目录 CLAUDE.md 只在被读到该目录下的文件时才懒加载(<a href=\"https://code.claude.com/docs/en/memory\">Claude Code 文档</a>)。这两条机制是同一枚硬币的两面:就近放置让局部变更只需局部更新,爆炸半径小;但也意味着局部文件烂掉了,只会在有人到该目录工作时才被发现——嵌套不是免责牌,而是把维护责任切分到包级别。</p>\n<h2 id=\"反模式与权衡\">反模式与权衡</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>只增不减。</strong> 上下文文件最常见的死法是膨胀:每条新指令都&quot;先加上&quot;,从不删除。Claude Code 官方建议单文件控制在 200 行以内,并明确指出更长会降低遵循度;Codex 用户则会在 32 KiB 截断处遭遇后半份文件静默失效。</li>\n<li><strong>用行号和清单当地图。</strong> &quot;见 src/utils/date.ts 第 42 行&quot;这类内容写入即开始腐坏;描述稳定概念(&quot;日期解析集中在 utils/date 模块&quot;)则能活过多次重构。</li>\n<li><strong>把审计做成仪式。</strong> 如果 <code>/memory show</code> 的输出从来没人读,它只是又一份没人看的文档。审计的价值在&quot;对照&quot;这个动作本身:生效内容 vs 当前现实,逐条过。</li>\n<li><strong>权衡:细节有用但易腐。</strong> 解法不是删光细节,而是给细节找低 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>λ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lambda</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span></span></span></span></span> 的表达形式(指针、原则、&quot;去哪里查&quot;),或放进与变更同 commit 维护的就近作用域里。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>过期的上下文比没有更糟:它剥夺 agent 的怀疑,还会与正确规则竞争并可能任意胜出。保鲜靠三层机制——变更即同步保证原子性,装载可观测(<code>/memory show</code>、<code>/context</code>)保证审计对着真实生效内容,就近作用域加低衰减表达做结构性防腐。下一节换一个方向:不看文件看出错,而从 agent 反复犯的错反推该补什么。</p>\n<h2 id=\"相关阅读\">相关阅读</h2><ul>\n<li><a href=\"context-from-recurring-mistakes\">从反复出错反推该补什么</a>：保鲜之外的另一条补给线——从重复失误定位缺口并回写。</li>\n<li><a href=\"../writing-effective-context/keeping-it-concise\">保持精炼</a>：长度红线的出处——依从性随长度下降的证据链与砍法。</li>\n<li><a href=\"../scaling-context-across-the-repo/pointers-not-duplication\">用指针而非重复</a>：结构性防腐的核心手法——让高衰减事实指向唯一会被同步的权威源。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"保持上下文新鲜","id":"保持上下文新鲜"},{"level":2,"text":"概述","id":"概述"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"过期比缺失更危险","id":"过期比缺失更危险"},{"level":2,"text":"过期从哪里发生","id":"过期从哪里发生"},{"level":2,"text":"保鲜的三层机制","id":"保鲜的三层机制"},{"level":2,"text":"反模式与权衡","id":"反模式与权衡"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"相关阅读","id":"相关阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"用指针而非重复","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-native-engineering/project-context-files/scaling-context-across-the-repo/pointers-not-duplication"},"next":{"title":"从反复出错反推该补什么","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-native-engineering/project-context-files/maintaining-context-files/context-from-recurring-mistakes"}}